<% pageTitle = "Kachhomal Sweets — Traditional Mithai in Ulhasnagar Since 1952" %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Ulhasnagar's mithai counter since 1952</span>
      <h1>Sweetness that's been weighed out for three generations.</h1>
      <p class="lede">From kaju katli to festival hampers, every batch at Kachhomal is still made the way it was in 1952 — pure ghee, fresh khoya, and a counter that knows your order before you finish saying it.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Place a Bulk / Festival Order</a>
        <a href="/menu" class="btn btn-ghost">View Menu</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="stat"><b>1952</b><span>Established</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><b>4.3 / 5</b><span>Customer Rating</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><b>5+</b><span>Ulhasnagar Outlets</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-media reveal">
      <div class="hero-media-frame">
        <img src="/images/hero-mithai.jpg" alt="Assorted traditional Indian sweets arranged on a platter" />
      </div>
      <div class="badge-stamp">Since<br />1952</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="scallop"></div>

<section class="section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">What we make</span>
      <h2>Four counters, one recipe book.</h2>
      <p>Everything is made fresh in-house daily — nothing is outsourced, nothing sits longer than it should.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-media"><img src="/images/kaju-katli.jpg" alt="Kaju katli sweets with silver leaf" /></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="card-tag">Signature</span>
          <h3>Kaju Katli</h3>
          <p>Cashew, sugar and a whisper of cardamom — cut thin, finished with silver leaf.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-media"><img src="/images/laddu.jpg" alt="Golden atta laddus garnished with nuts" /></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="card-tag">Everyday Favourite</span>
          <h3>Laddu</h3>
          <p>Besan, motichoor and atta laddus, rolled fresh each morning.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="card-media"><img src="/images/namkeen.jpg" alt="Bowl of crispy namkeen" /></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="card-tag">Savoury Side</span>
          <h3>Namkeen &amp; Sev</h3>
          <p>The crunchy counterpart to every mithai box — sold by weight, made fresh daily.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container split reverse">
    <div class="split-media reveal">
      <img src="/images/shop-front.jpg" alt="Kachhomal sweet shop storefront" />
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
      <h2>Three generations at the same counter.</h2>
      <p>Kachhomal opened its first counter in Ulhasnagar in 1952, serving a community rebuilding itself after Partition. What started as one shop selling laddu and barfi to neighbours has grown into a name Ulhasnagar reaches for at every wedding, festival and Sunday visit — without changing what made it trusted in the first place.</p>
      <a href="/about" class="btn btn-ghost">Read Our Full Story</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-maroon">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Trusted across Ulhasnagar</span>
      <h2>What the neighbourhood says.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="rating-strip reveal">
      <div class="rating-item"><b>4.3 / 5</b>Justdial · 600+ reviews</div>
      <div class="rating-item"><b>4.3 / 5</b>Magicpin · 70+ reviews</div>
      <div class="rating-item"><b>73 yrs</b>Serving Ulhasnagar</div>
      <div class="rating-item"><b>5+</b>Outlets across the city</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reels-head reveal">
      <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:0;">
        <span class="eyebrow">On Instagram</span>
        <h2>Fresh off the counter — @gkachhomal</h2>
        <p>Reels from the shop floor: what's fresh today, festival specials, and behind-the-counter moments.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="https://instagram.com/gkachhomal" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-gold">Follow on Instagram</a>
    </div>

    <div class="reels-grid reveal">
